Upstream-Name: vibeos-navi
Upstream-Contact: pulpoff <pashkovsky@gmail.com>
Source: https://github.com/pulpoff/vibeos
Comment:
 Navi (apps/navi), the libvibeos it was built with (libvibeos/) and the voice
 and speech code it shares with Agent and Dictate (apps/dictate/src) are
 VibeOS's. /usr/lib/vibeos-navi/libvibeos-navi-map.so.0 also holds MapLibre
 Native and the libraries MapLibre bundles, linked in statically; their
 notices are in LICENSES.maplibre.md.gz next to this file. No map data is
 shipped: the tiles come from VibeOS's map server (OpenStreetMap data, ODbL).

