Comment:
 The Russian voice's text front end, shared with Agent: a port to C of
 tiny-voca-ru's (https://github.com/yilbegan/tiny-voca-ru, version 0.2.1),
 which is based on tiny-voca (https://github.com/n4ze3m/tiny-voca). Its
 stress data, ruaccent's (MIT License), and the voice are downloaded, not
 shipped.

